      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T16:44:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right, I\u0027m pretty sure the media controls updates are sent to all connected devices regardless of the \"A2DP active\" state.\n\nWe\u0027re currently discussing if we should just remove the address in the java layer and send the update to all connected devices in the native stack, or call the native for each connected devices in the Java layer",
      "parentUuid": "c2d56e9d_bbda783e",
      "revId": "693eb7d2f20ee4ab145d94901ee62d1391192225",
